<!--
  Notification small-icon — silhouette of the real YOCINEMA reel-and-play
  logo (gold reel, 6 sprocket holes, center play triangle). Android renders
  status-bar icons using ONLY this image's alpha channel (API 21+), so the
  gold gradient/color from the real logo is dropped here — only the shape
  matters. The very fine sprocket perforations along the real logo's outer
  rim are also dropped: at 24dp they'd just render as noise, not detail.

  fillColor value itself doesn't affect rendering (only alpha does); opaque
  black is the standard convention for these assets.
-->
